    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d438-a1">

                <pb facs="0783" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg687"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 94.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">exchange voucher.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Oriental Bank Corporation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Yokohama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 16,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I hereby certify that the sight-rate on London ruling in Yokohama this date is
                        4<hi rendition="#italic">s</hi> 3<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>. per dollar,
                    and at this exchange the sum of $11,666.66 = £2,479 3<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >s</hi>. 4<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>.</p>
                <p>For the Oriental Bank Corporation:</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>J. ROBERTSON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Agent.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. W. Thomson</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Acting Accountant.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
